    "subtitle": "A little bunny who lives on this site",
    "story1": "Meet Mongi, a little bunny who lives on this site. Her name comes from 夢 (mong) — dreams at night, and dreams you carry through the day. With her round figure, pointy ears, and ever-shifting expressions, she's hard to miss.",
    "story2": "She used to live quietly up in the clouds, until one day the wind carried her all the way down here. She found people-watching far more fun than she expected and decided to stay. She's naturally curious and quick to react, though a bit easily startled if you catch her off guard.",
